beschrijving:
What does it take to build a tech hub? Join Aubay Portugal and IBM for a conversation on technology and business, followed by food and drinks. A 3-minute walk from the main stage. 

What to expect:

- A discussion on the challenges of building a tech hub;
- Networking around how to build tech teams;
- Drinks & food. 

Sign up here to confirm: https://luma.com/t0zlkfex

Durana Tech Park is hosting a meetup at our booth No 175, on November 11th, at 11.00 to showcase our virtual tech park model, 88 residents and a free economic zone in Albania with a special focus on INNOVATION; 

Talent. R&D partnerships. Investors. A soft-landing in the Western Balkans. All over a cup of coffee and cups of beer; 
See you there!
